  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,500eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Implanted Linear Frame β (Beta) or ∑ (Sigma)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances an Implanted Linear Frame of any kind. Once per Round, while not Seriously or Mortally Wounded and targeted by a Brawling, Martial Arts, or Melee Weapon attack, the user may activate this without an Action to use BODY instead of DEX for their Evasion check.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fits any implanted Linear Frame, including the named ones (Fūma Kotarō, LF-001 SWAT, Vermilion), not only the Beta and Sigma.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Borgware).</em></p>"
